  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to strengthen Slovakias position as a provider of development cooperation in the field of security sector reform. The goal is realized through cooperation with SEESAC, primarily in the field of strengthening the gender principle in the armies, especially in the Western Balkans.</narrative>
