     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women in the Military Initiative:
- Strengthened capacities for gender responsive and evidence-based policy development and implementation of Gender Equality Mechanisms in the Ministries of Defense and Armed Forces through information sharing and knowledge exchange of Gender Equality Mechanism, decision makers and military commanders. 
- Strengthened regional cooperation of MoDs and Armed Forces in the Western Balkans through the regional platform for gender equality in the military. 
?	Increased capacities of MoDs for evidence-based policymaking through research and analysis of data and enhanced knowledge for prevention and response to gender-based discrimination, sexual harassment. This is done through the implementation of small-scale projects developed by the MoDs.</narrative>
